   "t": "html",
   "html": "<pre class=\"syntax\">template &lt;class T, class... CtorArgs&gt; [[nodiscard]] T * new_object (CtorArgs &amp;&amp;... ctor_args) noexcept(<a class=\"cppref\" href=\"https://en.cppreference.com/w/cpp/types/is_constructible\" title=\"cppreference.com (C++17)\">std::is_nothrow_constructible</a>&lt; T, CtorArgs... &gt;::value);</pre>",
   "tail": "\n"
  },
  {
   "t": "html",
   "html": "<div class=\"desc\"><p>As per corresponding usage in [mem.poly.allocator.class] except for the following deviations: 1. Function is conditionally noexcept 2. If unsuccessful: nullptr is returned, instead of raising any Exception</p></div>",
